#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanIntro"
msgid ""
"DAN: While searching for treasures,\n"
"we discovered a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：我们在寻宝的时候，\n"
"发现了一个训练家！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanDefeat"
msgid ""
"DAN: We couldn't win even though\n"
"we worked together…$"
msgstr "阿丹：我们齐心协力也没能赢……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"DAN: We can't find any treasures…\n"
"I wonder if someone got them already?$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：我们什么宝物都找不到……\n"
"是不是已经被别人拿走了？$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"DAN: You don't even have two POKéMON.\n"
"You can't expect to beat us like that.$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：你连两只宝可梦都没有。\n"
"这样可别想打败我们。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraIntro"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Oh?\n"
"We were searching for treasures.\l"
"But we discovered a TRAINER instead!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：哎呀？我们本来在寻宝的。\n"
"结果却发现了一个训练家！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:73
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraDefeat"
msgid "KIRA: Ooh, so strong!$"
msgstr "绮拉：哦，好强！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Where could the treasures be?\p"
"I've already decided what I'm buying\n"
"when we find the treasures!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：宝物会在哪里呢？\p"
"我已经想好找到宝物以后要买什么了！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:81
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Oh, you don't have two POKéMON?\n"
"We'll have to battle some other time!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：哎呀，你没有两只宝可梦吗？\n"
"那我们只好下次再对战了！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:85
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraRegister"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Oh, you make me so angry!\n"
"I'm going to register you for that!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：哎呀，真让人生气！\n"
"我要把你登记下来！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:89
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"DAN: We've been searching for\n"
"treasures all this time.\p"
"Our POKéMON have grown stronger, too.\n"
"Let us show you, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：我们一直都在寻宝。\p"
"我们的宝可梦也变强了。\n"
"让你见识一下吧？$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:95
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanRematchDefeat"
msgid "DAN: You're strong, as usual!$"
msgstr "阿丹：你还是那么强！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:98
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanPostRematch"
msgid ""
"DAN: We can't find any treasures,\n"
"we lose at POKéMON…\p"
"I want to go home… But if I say that,\n"
"she gets all angry with me…$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：宝物找不到，\n"
"宝可梦对战也输了……\p"
"我想回家了……可是我一这么说，\n"
"她就会对我发脾气……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_DanRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"DAN: You don't even have two POKéMON.\n"
"You can't expect to beat us like that.$"
msgstr ""
"阿丹：你连两只宝可梦都没有。\n"
"这样可别想打败我们。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Oh? We meet again!\p"
"Just like us, you still haven't given up\n"
"searching for treasures, have you?\p"
"Want to make it so the loser has\n"
"to give up searching?$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：哎呀？我们又见面了！\p"
"你和我们一样，还没有放弃寻宝吧？\p"
"要不要定个规矩，\n"
"输的一方就得放弃寻宝？$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:115
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraRematchDefeat"
msgid "KIRA: Oh, we lost again…$"
msgstr "绮拉：哎呀，我们又输了……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:118
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraPostRematch"
msgid ""
"KIRA: We're not leaving until we raise\n"
"our POKéMON some more and we find\l"
"the treasures here!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：在把宝可梦培养得更强、找到这\n"
"里的宝物之前，我们是不会离开的！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:123
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_KiraRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"KIRA: Oh, you don't have two POKéMON?\n"
"We'll have to battle some other time!$"
msgstr ""
"绮拉：哎呀，你没有两只宝可梦吗？\n"
"那我们只好下次再对战了！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_JaniIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm not good at swimming,\n"
"but I am good at battles!$"
msgstr "我不擅长游泳，但我很擅长对战！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:131
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_JaniDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oops.\n"
"That didn't go very well.$"
msgstr "哎呀。不太顺利呢。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:135
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_JaniPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Walking around barefoot in this ship\n"
"is kind of gross.$"
msgstr ""
"光着脚在这艘船里走来走去，\n"
"感觉有点恶心。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:139
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_GarrisonIntro"
msgid ""
"Strength and compassion…\n"
"Those are a TRAINER's treasures!$"
msgstr "力量与慈爱……这些才是训练家的宝物！$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:143
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_GarrisonDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ah, there is something about you\n"
"that sparkles.$"
msgstr "啊，你身上有种闪闪发光的东西。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F/scripts.inc:147
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_Rooms2_1F_Text_GarrisonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"In a cabin somewhere on board,\n"
"I saw something sparkle.$"
msgstr ""
"我在船上某个客舱里，\n"
"看到有东西在闪闪发光。$"
